WEBVTT

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.615
legs without circulation,
death from stroke,

00:03:00.639 --> 00:03:01.790
nerve damage.

00:03:02.457 --> 00:03:04.774
And on the other end,
excessive angiogenesis --

00:03:04.798 --> 00:03:06.975
too many blood vessels -- drives disease,

00:03:06.999 --> 00:03:09.587
and we see this in cancer, blindness,

00:03:09.611 --> 00:03:12.460
arthritis, obesity, Alzheimer's disease.

00:03:13.306 --> 00:03:16.449
In total, there are more
than 70 major diseases

00:03:16.473 --> 00:03:18.942
affecting more than a billion
people worldwide,

00:03:18.966 --> 00:03:21.934
that all look on the surface to be
different from one another,

00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:24.776
but all actually share
abnormal angiogenesis

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.521
as their common denominator.

00:03:27.371 --> 00:03:30.448
And this realization is allowing
us to re-conceptualize